          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malingana ni malamusi ga Mose ŵandu ŵiŵaliji atamose ŵakulepetala ŵasagulidwaga kuŵa acakulungwa ŵa ŵakutaga mbopesi wosope. Nambo cilanga ca Mlungu catamilicice ni kulumbilila, cele cayice panyuma pa malamusigo, gele gigamŵisile Mwanagwe, jwele juŵaliji jwangali ulemwa yaka yosope kuti aŵe jwamkulungwa jwa ŵa ŵakutaga mbopesi wosope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.7.28"
            ]
          }
        }
